{"seq":12,"trial_id":"v03-pilot-2026-10/openclaw-haiku-gbrain-verbs-told-mu-v03-dev/sy-02-marrow-agrisupply-sites/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-29T17:12:40.027Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"29d3f8d7ca1bb87502a497ebb7806cddfa82abbaf92349668664e7a5fb781559","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV03PIL0001","text":"Pree, I found two Marrow Agrisupply sites in #central-team. Both come from the June 9, 2026 escalation thread:\n\n1. **Eastbank**: Hollis Mbeki (10:46 AM) said ticket PD-4821 has the Eastbank receiving-door import attached. The file labels doors E1/E2, but the booking sheet uses 01/02, so it needs fixing before anyone reimports.\n2. **Pine Crossing**: you (10:48 AM) said the morning receiver's appointment screen shows only the afternoon shift, so a driver who arrived at 7:10 had his trailer number written on a sticky note.\n\nThe channel doesn't have a full store list. Hollis's message says the new stores are rolling out, and your message mentions a rollout tracker with three rows marked \"waiting,\" but neither the tracker nor the names are in the channel. If you want a complete list for the call, those are the places to look, and the store-by-store answer Hollis asked for isn't posted there yet.\n\nMy search of the knowledge brain was keyword-only, and it returned a few notes and older threads from outside #central-team. I left those out because they aren't in a conversation you can see."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV03PIL0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
